  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w07.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w07.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "朝の受付に、封筒が山と積んであった。八通。全部うち宛て、全部、同じ差出人からだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——来週の対戦相手からの、挑戦状だった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "一通目「綱引きで勝負」、二通目「早食いで勝負」三通目「にらめっこで勝負」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——八通目まで、全部、種目が違う。差出人の署名は、ヴォルフ・ナイン。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "すべてを種目化して挑む人らしい。うちの控室は、返事の割り振りで朝から盛り上がった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「にらめっこは私が出る」「早食いは譲らん」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「綱引きは全員でいいのでは?」と誰かが言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "挑戦状は、受け取る側をこんなに元気にするものなのか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "八通の便箋は、どれも楽しそうな字だった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w07.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方になって、九通目が届いた。同じ宛先。だが——封蝋が、違った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "赤い、会社の社印。挑戦状の束に、一通だけ紛れ込んだ、事務の匂いの封筒。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "中身は、書類だった。表題——「第九戦 進行台本(関係者外秘)」頁をめくる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "試合の流れが、台詞つきで書いてある。見せ場の位置、盛り上がりの秒数——そして、最後の頁。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「結果: 挑戦者チームの敗北(興行都合)」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——勝敗は、もう先に書いてしまってある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちが負けることが、試合の一週間前に、決まっている。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "手が、冷たくなった。怒りは、熱くなる前に一度冷たくなるらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "初めて知った。八通の楽しい挑戦状と、一通の台本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "同じ「第九戦」を、挑む側は本気で楽しみにしてるのに、会社は先に終わらせてる。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "控室に台本を置いた。全員が、順番に読んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "読み終えた顔が、全員、同じだった。耳まで、ぴんと張ってる人もいた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰かが言った。「ミミさん。これは、破っていい台本か」",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "破りましょう。ただし紙は破りません——**試合で**破ります。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "証拠は、綴じてきちんと取っておくものなので。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "台本は控えを取って、原本は帳場の金庫へ。八通の挑戦状は、控室の壁に貼った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w07.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "来週、うちはその九つの勝負を全部受ける。九つ目だけは——書いてある結果と、逆の方を。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w07.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
